    },
    {
      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=118554",
      "title": "Brut’s blueprint for connecting young journalists with young audiences",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/bruts-blueprint-for-connecting-young-journalists-with-young-audiences/",
      "published": "Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:14:17 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>In the 10 years since its creation, the French outlet has become a staple in its home market while building a massive international footprint. Its success hinges on a distinct video-native approach that prioritises trust and community.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/bruts-blueprint-for-connecting-young-journalists-with-young-audiences/\">Brut’s blueprint for connecting young journalists with young audiences</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
